cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this MCP server, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: Climate Risk MCP Server
abstract: >-
  MCP server for drought and climate anomalies at any point on Earth. It
  computes SPI and SPEI drought indices, temperature and rain anomalies against
  the 1991-2020 baseline, and drought charts from the ERA5 reanalysis (ECMWF,
  Copernicus Climate Change Service) served by the Open-Meteo Historical
  Weather API.
